<title>INDONESIA: President Suharto resting on Monday after trip.</title>
<headline>President Suharto resting on Monday after trip.</headline>
<dateline>JAKARTA 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>President Suharto was resting on Monday after his visits last week to Jordan and Italy and had no scheduled appointments, palace officials said.</p>
</text>
